#: ../../source/fork-ts-checker-webpack-plugin_CHANGELOG.md:84
msgid ""
"There are actually no breaking changes that we're aware of; users of 0.x "
"`fork-ts-checker-webpack-plugin` should be be able to upgrade without any"
" drama. Users of TypeScript 3+ may notice a performance improvement as by"
" default the plugin now uses the [incremental watch "
"API](https://github.com/Microsoft/TypeScript/pull/20234) in TypeScript. "
"Should this prove problematic you can opt out of using it by supplying "
"`useTypescriptIncrementalApi: false`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/fork-ts-checker-webpack-plugin_CHANGELOG.md:86
msgid ""
"We are aware of an [issue with Vue and the incremental "
"API](https://github.com/TypeStrong/fork-ts-checker-webpack-"
"plugin/issues/219). We hope it will be fixed soon - a generous member of "
"the community is taking a look. In the meantime, we will _not_ default to"
" using the incremental watch API when in Vue mode."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/fork-ts-checker-webpack-plugin_CHANGELOG.md:88
msgid ""
"The plugin supports webpack 2, 3, 4 and 5 alpha and TypeScript 2.1+ "
"alongside tslint 4+."
